\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. WHO in the Lord confide,
\par And feel His sprinkled blood,
\par In storms and hurricanes abide,
\par Firm as the mount of God:
\par Steadfast and fixed and sure,
\par His Zion cannot move;
\par His faithful people stand secure
\par In Jesu's guardian love.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. As round Jerusalem
\par The hily bulwarks rise,
\par So God protects and covers them
\par From all their enemies.
\par On every side He stands,
\par And for His Israel cares;
\par And safe in His almighty hands
\par Their souls for ever bears.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. But let them still abide
\par In Thee, all-gracious Lord,
\par Till every soul is sanctified
\par And perfectly restored:
\par The men of heart sincere
\par Continue to defend;
\par And do them good, and save them here,
\par And love them to the end.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

